00:04:51,000 --> 00:04:57,000
Honey 3: Dare to Dance is a music, drama, family
film directed by Bille Woodruff.

2
00:09:42,000 --> 00:09:48,000
While attending college in Cape Town, Melea Martin feels constrained by the
school's strict policies, and decides to set out on her own.

3
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:39,000
Searching for a way to use her talents as a dancer and inspire the community around her, Melea
rents a failing theater in order to put on a Hip-Hop Romeo and Juliet performance.

4
00:19:24,000 --> 00:19:30,000
But much like the Capulets and Montagues, conflicts between cast
members threaten to bring the whole performance to a halt...

5
00:24:15,000 --> 00:24:21,000
Melea Martin, played by Cassie Ventura.

6
00:29:06,000 --> 00:29:12,000
Erik Wildwood, played by Kenny Wormald.

7
00:33:57,000 --> 00:34:03,000
Nadine, played by Dena Kaplan.

